{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28681","headline":"闻蝉 · 杜牧","name":"闻蝉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火云初似灭，晓角欲微清。\n故国行千里，新蝉忽数声。\n时行仍髣髴，度日更分明。\n不敢频倾耳，唯忧白发生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}